flowchart TD
  A[Data snapshot<br/>provenance, consent, scope, label maturity] --> B[Feature build<br/>contract, transforms, leakage and proxy review]
  B --> C[Candidate training<br/>baseline, challenger, convergence, reproducibility]
  C --> D[Evaluation<br/>performance, calibration, stability, stress]
  D --> E[Fairness review<br/>selection, error, calibration, uncertainty]
  E --> F[Independent validation<br/>conceptual soundness, implementation, outcomes]
  F --> G{Approval gate}
  G -->|approved| H[Registry publication<br/>signed artifact, digest, policy, limitations]
  G -->|rejected or conditioned| B
  H --> I[Controlled serving<br/>canary, monitoring, rollback]
  I --> J{Monitoring breach?}
  J -->|no| I
  J -->|yes| K[Freeze promotion<br/>preserve evidence<br/>assess harm]
  K -->|rollback| H
  K -->|data or model defect| A
